{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19710","headline":"合江亭槛前多高竹不见远岸花客命翦之感而成咏 · 吕温","name":"合江亭槛前多高竹不见远岸花客命翦之感而成咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吉凶岂前卜，人事何飜覆。\n缘看数日花，却翦凌霜竹。\n常言契君操，今乃妨衆目。\n自古病当门，谁言出幽独。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19710.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19710","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}